      "text": "The January 8 business-award option arriving in Bangkok at 4:15 a.m. January 10 may suit you if an earlier arrival is useful. It combines a reported 275,000 Turkish miles with a USD 59 quoted SFO–LAX fare, but award taxes and their scope are unknown. Seat availability and traveler coverage for the points quote are also unreported, and the positioning and award flights are on separate, unverified tickets; confirm availability and whether the connection works for you before booking.",
